---- MODULE Sync ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from sync.mmd.
\* Each region is one variable and each transition label is one action.
\* Once you add guards and variables from the real code, this file is the source.
\* statechart.mjs from-chart sync.mmd keeps it, checks it, and compares it with the chart.

VARIABLES connection, syncBadge
vars == <<connection, syncBadge>>

\* Region Connection
connectionStates == {"Offline", "Online"}
\* Region Sync badge
syncBadgeStates == {"Synced", "Waiting to sync"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ connection \in connectionStates
    /\ syncBadge \in syncBadgeStates

Init ==
    /\ connection = "Online"
    /\ syncBadge = "Synced"

\* the network drops
TheNetworkDrops ==
    /\ (connection \in {"Online"} \/ syncBadge \in {"Synced"})
    /\ \/ (connection = "Online" /\ connection' = "Offline")
       \/ (connection \notin {"Online"} /\ UNCHANGED connection)
    /\ \/ (syncBadge = "Synced" /\ syncBadge' = "Waiting to sync")
       \/ (syncBadge \notin {"Synced"} /\ UNCHANGED syncBadge)

\* the network returns
TheNetworkReturns ==
    /\ \/ (connection = "Offline" /\ connection' = "Online")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<syncBadge>>

\* you edit a note
YouEditANote ==
    /\ \/ (syncBadge = "Synced" /\ syncBadge' = "Waiting to sync")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<connection>>

\* the server confirms
TheServerConfirms ==
    /\ \/ (syncBadge = "Waiting to sync" /\ syncBadge' = "Synced")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<connection>>

Next == TheNetworkDrops \/ TheNetworkReturns \/ YouEditANote \/ TheServerConfirms

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

\* You never see "Synced" while you are offline.
NeverSyncedWhileOffline == ~(connection = "Offline" /\ syncBadge = "Synced")

====
